{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14221100","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14221100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1422110001:1":{"text":"你要弄谁？","source_cn":"你要弄谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE3248D2652B26D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422110002:0":{"text":"你……？啊，这不是卫队长大人嘛！我说着玩的！你还记得我吗？以前你在平民区的时候，我……","source_cn":"你……？啊，这不是卫队长大人嘛！我说着玩的！你还记得我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807BE597CCBD6051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422110003:0":{"text":"你有没有见过一个叫艾莎的女孩？或者穿贵族服饰的人？","source_cn":"你有没有见过一个叫艾莎的女孩？或者穿贵族服饰的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x301D6CB4665FCD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422110004:1":{"text":"艾莎……没见过什么叫艾莎的。要说穿贵族衣服的，还真见了一个，那人穿着那身衣服还好意思排队领恩典灵露！","source_cn":"艾莎……没见过什么叫艾莎的。要说穿贵族衣服的，还真见了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5794DBE73EFA5DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422110005:1":{"text":"平民区的灵露本来就不够分，城里的贵族老爷有喝不完的灵露，现在反倒跑到我们的地盘来分灵露了！","source_cn":"平民区的灵露本来就不够分，城里的贵族老爷有喝不完的灵露...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC765B6B291B8215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","d